  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added multi-ring and per-cell distance-limited Boolean dilation and erosion with linear-time traversal and spatial geometry preservation. Added Voronoi empty-cell policies, region masks, and combined participation and region masks. Region assignments are restricted to sites in the same region. Breaking API change: Dilate, Erode, Open, and Close moved from BooleanHexMapExtensions to IHexMapBoolExtensions and ISpatialHexMapBoolExtensions; extension-call syntax is unchanged, but explicit static calls and previously compiled consumers must be updated or rebuilt. The minimum Akeldov.Math.Spatial2D dependency remains 1.1.0, with compatible 1.x releases accepted.",
